<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines raises reverse repo rates to 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines raises reverse repo rates to 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank on Wednesday raised its one-day reverse repo rate for the second time in the day and pledged to increase rates again if necessary to defend the peso.</p>
<p>The one-day reverse repo rate was boosted to 24 percent from 20 percent set earlier in the morning following Wednesday's effective devaluation of the Thai baht.</p>
</text>
